Three stages:

1. Generate Results
    - Put a datafile into the "DATA" folder.
    - Make sure the file path is updated to that file name.
    - This code will perform DR&Clustering and save reduced datafile.
    - See "RESULTS" folder for the saved items.

2. Analyze Results
    - Load an interactive plot for viewing the DR results.
    - Make sure to set file paths to the correct items in the "RESULTS" folder.

3. Sensitivity Analysis   
    - Experiment with different PaCMAP iteration values by setting "min_iters", "max_iters", and "interval".